                    %mi 𝒮𝒞
                    %mi N
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathcal{SC}_N
            be the cubical Swiss cheese relative operad, a colored operad over the colors
            = succeed "," do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
