              %a{:href => "#VVieira2020"}> Vieira 2020, Proposition 2.2.3
              ) We have a weak Quillen adjunction
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
